# Agentic Evals
- Everything related to Evaluating Agents.

---
# Overview
- Evaluating Agents is not a simple as writing a 20 page prompt and asking GPT-5 to "kindly would you please evaluate this". The year is 2026 (almost 2027) and Agentic systems are not only state of the art but they function on a different level. 
- Agentic Evals are not only multi-tier, but the system you design to evaluate agentic frameworks needs to be holistic and each eval metric or framework needs to complement the other. 
- Agents are not static frameworks, they are dynamic, and thus the evaluation system needs to be dynamic as well. 



